# CODEOWNERS for xdbml-spec
#
# Specifies who must review pull requests touching specific paths.
# Combined with branch protection requiring code-owner review,
# this ensures every change to the spec, grammar, examples, governance,
# or site goes through a maintainer before merging.
#
# Syntax: <path pattern>    <owner1> <owner2> ...
# Patterns earlier in the file are overridden by patterns later in the file.
#
# See: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositories-settings-and-security/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# Default: every file requires review from a project maintainer.
*                                     @pdesmarets

# As maintainers are added, scope ownership to areas of expertise.
# Examples (uncomment and adjust when applicable):
#
# /spec/                              @pdesmarets @spec-editor
# /grammar/                           @pdesmarets @grammar-maintainer
# /examples/                          @pdesmarets
# /.vitepress/                        @pdesmarets @site-maintainer
# /.github/workflows/                 @pdesmarets
# /LICENSE                            @pdesmarets
# /NOTICE                             @pdesmarets
# /GOVERNANCE.md                      @pdesmarets
